        <li class="c-sync"><h3 class="h3">{T('Invite Friends')}</h3><p>{T('Exchange invitation and reply codes by chat or email. They contain the addresses that were just found, so each friend can connect straight to the organizer, without any server in between.')}</p></li>
        <li class="c-sync"><h3 class="h3">{T('Share the Course')}</h3><p>{T('The organizer shares a prepared course or a workout. It downloads directly from the organizer to everyone and stays in their library.')}</p></li>
